READ `oracle - base` FIRST. It uses past images and is not a method; it is the
   ceiling. The legal arms are restricted to span(V_o) and cannot exceed it.
`reaim - reaim_g0` is the only honest effect size. reaim_g0 re-solves and
   re-clusters WITHOUT looking at other classes, so it absorbs the reshuffling
   noise that re-aiming would otherwise get credit for.
